feat: Phase 9 -- pipeline hardening, integration tests, and feedback loop

Server-side gate extraction (validate_and_filter.py):
- Extract inline gate logic from both decision YAMLs into shared module
- EP ceiling by actual source count (1->0.55, 2->0.65, 3->0.75, 4->0.85, 5->0.90)
- VIX > 30 universal hard gate for all directional alerts
- Source-hallucination detection (delta >= 2 hard reject, == 1 downgrade)
- Rewire decision-15m.yaml and decision-1h.yaml to use extracted module

Notifier hardening (notifier_and_logger.py):
- Atomic dedup via SET NX+EX (eliminates TOCTOU race)
- Content-aware dedup with thesis hash + Jaccard similarity override
- Persist-first ordering: Postgres INSERT before Discord send

Prompt enrichment (prompt_manager.py):
- Snapshot freshness injection with stale-data warnings
- FRED data freshness detection (CACHED sentinel)
- Win-rate context injection via winrate_injector.py
- Golden few-shot examples from Langfuse datasets
- Dynamic quality escalation rules based on recent scores
- Enhanced 1h macro emphasis rules

Feedback loop:
- winrate_injector.py: per-bucket win-rate from resolved alerts
- db.py: get_recent_winrate_summary() for prompt calibration
- langfuse_datasets.py: get_golden_examples() for few-shot injection

Observability (healthcheck.py):
- Redis snapshot staleness check (TTL monitoring)
- Langfuse connectivity check (non-blocking)

Quality scoring (alert_quality.py):
- Expanded technical terms frozenset
- Improved batch diversity scoring with overlap detection

Tests:
- tests/test_validate_and_filter.py (27 tests)
- tests/test_winrate_injector.py (13 tests)
- tests/test_pipeline_integration.py (9 tests, 3 skip without redis)
- tests/unit/test_alert_quality.py (comprehensive quality scoring tests)
- tests/unit/test_notifier.py (thesis similarity + content-aware dedup)
- tests/unit/test_prompt_manager.py (freshness, winrate, escalation)
